# Keys and certificates never enter the repository (the server's TLS keys stay
# offline, server/DW4Online/deploy/DEPLOY.md 6.1); the client's pins come from
# the build (local/online_pins.txt or -DDW4_ONLINE_PINS).
*.pem
*.pfx
*.p12
*.key
